# Secrets hygiene (B8, testnet-readiness-review.md §2). These patterns catch
# any per-network .env / deployer key file added from here on, without a
# `git add -A` accidentally committing a funded private key.
#
# NOTE: sandbox-local/.env is ALREADY TRACKED (holds a keyed RPC URL, no
# private key) from before this .gitignore existed. Adding these patterns
# does NOT untrack it — that's a deliberate no-op here; untracking it is the
# repo owner's call, not made in this change.
*/.env
*/.env.*
!*/.env.example
*/deployer-account.json
**/.env.local
